## 1. DEVICE IDENTIFICATION:
id: tiva-c-launchpad-tm4c129
name: "TI EK-TM4C1294XL Connected LaunchPad — TM4C1294NCPDT ARM Cortex-M4F 120MHz, 1MB Flash, 256KB RAM, 90 GPIO, On-chip ETH MAC+PHY, USB OTG, 2xCAN, 10xI2C"
manufacturer: "Texas Instruments"
mcu: "TI TM4C1294NCPDT — ARM Cortex-M4F 120MHz; IEEE754 FPU; 32-ch uDMA; On-chip ETH MAC+PHY; 2xADC-12bit-2MSPS; 8xUART; 4xSSI; 10xI2C; 2xCAN; USB-OTG"
category: maker
